      {
        "purpose": "transcribing",
        "value": "兵士五十人　農兵六十四人　兵卒五十五人"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "modern_jp_reading",
        "value": "兵士 50人／農兵 64人／兵卒 55人"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "english_translation",
        "value": "Composition of Asao's two and a half companies: 50 samurai soldiers (heishi), 64 peasant soldiers (nohei), 55 foot soldiers (heisotsu). The three items are set as a double-column warichu note: 兵士五十人 in the right sub-column with 農兵六十四人 beside it in the left, and 兵卒五十五人 below them in the right sub-column. The three add to 169 men; the page prints no total, and 169 over two and a half companies works out at about 68 men per company."
      },
      {
        "purpose": "identifying",
        "value": "淺尾藩兵隊内訳"
      }
    ],
